Step 1: Start the Program
🪙Initialize the Cloud Security Auditor.
🪙Create an empty list to store security findings.
Purpose: Prepare the system to collect detected vulnerabilities.
Step 2: Check IAM Root Account MFA
🪙Access IAM account details.
🪙Verify whether Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) is enabled for the root account.
If MFA is not enabled:
Create a security finding.
Mark severity as Critical.
Store the finding in the report.
Purpose: Protect the AWS root account from unauthorized access.
Step 3: Check S3 Bucket Security
🪙Retrieve S3 bucket configurations.
🪙Verify Public Access Block settings.
If public access is allowed:
Create a security finding.
Mark severity as High.
Add the finding to the report.
Purpose: Prevent sensitive data exposure.
Step 4: Check EC2 Security Groups
🪙Retrieve all EC2 Security Groups.
🪙Analyze inbound firewall rules.
Check whether ports are open to 0.0.0.0/0 (everyone).
If unrestricted access is found:
Create a security finding.
Mark severity as High.
Store the finding.
Purpose: Prevent unauthorized network access.
Step 5: Check RDS Database Encryption
🪙Retrieve RDS database instances.
🪙Verify storage encryption settings.
If encryption is disabled:
Create a security finding.
Mark severity as Medium.
Add the finding.
Purpose: Protect stored database information.
Step 6: Execute Audits in Parallel
🪙Create a list of all audit functions:
🪙IAM Audit
🪙S3 Audit
🪙Security Group Audit
🪙RDS Audit
🪙Run all audits simultaneously using ThreadPoolExecutor.
Purpose: Reduce audit execution time.
Step 7: Generate Security Report
🪙Collect all findings.
🪙Convert findings into JSON format.
🪙Display the final report.
Purpose: Provide a readable summary of detected vulnerabilities.
Step 8: End Program
Display the total number of findings.
START

Create Findings List

Check Root Account MFA
IF MFA Disabled
    Add Critical Finding
END IF

Check S3 Bucket Access
IF Public Access Enabled
    Add High Severity Finding
END IF

Check Security Group Rules
IF Open Access Detected
    Add High Severity Finding
END IF

Check RDS Encryption
IF Encryption Disabled
    Add Medium Severity Finding
END IF

Generate Security Report

Display Findings

END
Stop the auditor.
